# Vercel hosts the static demo only — the contents of public/.
#
# Everything below is the local camp server. If Vercel can see it, it detects
# a Node app and builds server.js into a serverless function, which then
# crashes on import because db.js writes a SQLite file to a read-only disk.
# Hiding these files leaves an unambiguous static site.

server.js
db.js
package.json
package-lock.json
START CAMP.bat
data/
